#: bd607fdc4f5142e1be2c376a2674e4b5
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:123
#: 8612dd39d3e644398ee63c355b47b956
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected in order "
"for autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"此飞控不含 GPS 或罗盘，需连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"方可使用自主飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:125
#: c9fad65c8434428a83986a3ef644e250
msgid ""
"If the GPS is attached to UART2 TX/RX and powered from the adjacent 4.5V "
"pins, it will be powered when connected via USB, as would the RX if powered "
"from the adjacent 4.5V pins to UART6."
msgstr ""
"如果 GPS 连接到 UART2 TX/RX 并由相邻的 4.5V 引脚供电，则通过 USB 连接时也会供电；同样，如果接收机由 UART6 相邻的 "
"4.5V 引脚供电，也会如此。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:127
#: b0b0e8c2b68042c683a74b1208bcd76e
msgid ""
"A battery must be plugged in for power to be provided to the pins marked 5V "
"on the board."
msgstr "必须插入电池，才能向飞控上标记为 5V 的引脚提供电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:130
