#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:152
#: 206f44a50f01421eb2e66c677829cced
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to \"1\" to enable RX6 pin as true"
" UART input (see RC Input section above)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「1」可将 RX6 引脚启用为真正的 UART 输入（参见上方 "
"RC 输入章节）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:153
#: 276d5a44a8a84ed686b9835f505b7d7f
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to \"2\" to change RTS7 and CTS7 "
"pins to GPIO 1 and 2, respectively."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「2」可将 RTS7 和 CTS7 引脚分别更改为 GPIO 1 "
"和 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:154
#: 343c1dc6708f4e2797c448371ec5162c
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to \"3\" to enable both of the "
"above."
msgstr "将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「3」可同时启用上述两项。"

